  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ロトムパワーの　ひとつ。\nつかうと　フレンドリィショップの\nしょうひんが　はんがくに　なる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "로토무파워 중 하나.\n사용하면 프렌들리숍의\n상품이 반값이 된다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "洛托姆之力的一種。\n使用後，友好商店的\n商品就會變成半價。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une des Motism’Auras. Elle permet de réduire\nde moitié le coût des objets vendus dans\nles Boutiques Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Diese Rotom-Kraft bewirkt, dass die Preise im\nPokémon-Supermarkt halbiert werden.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Poder Rotom que reduce a la mitad el coste de los\nartículos en las Tiendas Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Potere Rotom che consente di acquistare\ni prodotti del Pokémon-Market a metà prezzo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "One of the Rotom Powers.\nIt reduces the prices of products at Poké Marts\nby half.",
